{"t":"To Blind the Enemy Quest","s":"to-blind-the-enemy-quest-6a94f","k":"quest","i":"assets/wiki/To_Blind_the_enemy_57a203.png","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">To Blind the Enemy Quest</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aka\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Aliases</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Reflect Quest</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"log\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Log</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Tibia%20Tales\">Tibia Tales</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lvl\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0<br/>(30+ recommended)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8.10<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 11, 2007<br/>Christmas Update 2007</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Quests</nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-quest-legend\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Legend\">Legend</span></h3>\n<p>The elves need your help in a war against nearby villains.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Ab%27Dendriel\">Ab'Dendriel</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Elvenbane\">Elvenbane</a> castle\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-dangers\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dangers\">Dangers</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Troll\">Troll</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc\">Orcs</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf\">Dwarf</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur\">Minotaurs</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Guard\">Minotaur Guard</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc%20Warrior\">Orc Warriors</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc%20Berserker\">Orc Berserker</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc%20Shaman\">Orc Shaman</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\">Dragon</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Demon%20Skeleton\">Demon Skeletons</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Mage\">Minotaur Mage</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Elf%20Arcanist\">Elf Arcanist</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-reward\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Reward\">Reward</span></h3>\n<p>10 <a href=\"#/wiki/Platinum%20Coin\">Platinum Coins</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Elven%20Amulet\">Elven Amulet</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-spoiler\">\n<div class=\"tw-cmd showhide-visible showhide-init quest-spoiler\" data-command=\"showhide-content\" data-showhide-value=\"visible\">\n<div class=\"showhide-header\" data-showhide-element=\"header\">Click to show/hide the quest spoiler.<br/><span style=\"font-size: 0.8em;\">(settings)</span></div>\n<div class=\"showhide-body\" data-showhide-element=\"body\">\n<div class=\"spoiler-pretext\">Spoiler • edit</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Required_Equipment\">Required Equipment</span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Destroy%20Field%20Rune\">Destroy Field Rune</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Shovel\">Shovel</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Rope\">Rope</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Mirror\">Mirror</a> (provided by <a href=\"#/wiki/Eroth\">Eroth</a>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Method\">Method</span></h2>\n<p>Go to <a href=\"#/wiki/Ab%27Dendriel\">Ab'Dendriel</a>. Go up one floor in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Depot\">depot</a> and head west. Talk to the NPC <a href=\"#/wiki/Eroth\">Eroth</a> about a mission. He will say you have to destroy an orb in the top of the tower of <a href=\"#/wiki/Elvenbane\">Elvenbane</a> with a <a href=\"#/wiki/Mirror\">Mirror</a>.\n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb show-info-icon\" style=\"width: 259px\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> <img alt=\"To Blind the enemy\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"173\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/To_Blind_the_enemy_57a203.png\" width=\"259\"/> <figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> <svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg> </figcaption> </figure>\n<p>Enter the <a href=\"#/wiki/Elvenbane\">Elvenbane Fortress</a> <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32579,31680,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32579, 31680, 7)</a> (you'll need a <a href=\"#/wiki/Destroy%20Field%20Rune\">Destroy Field Rune</a>) and go into the central tower. Go up to the last floor (be prepared to face many monsters, listed above) and use the <a href=\"#/wiki/Mirror\">Mirror</a> on the <a href=\"#/wiki/Scrying%20Ball\">Scrying Ball</a> you see there.\n</p><p>Report back to <a href=\"#/wiki/Eroth\">Eroth</a> to get your reward.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Transcripts\">Transcripts</span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Eroth\">Eroth</a> in <a href=\"#/wiki/Ab%27Dendriel\">Ab'Dendriel</a></li></ul>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>hi</b><br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Eroth\">Eroth</a>: I greet thee, outsider.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>mission</b><br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Eroth\">Eroth</a>: Have you ever heard of Elvenbane? It is the castle west of Ab'Dendriel which is inhabited by villains from all over the continent. Any support in this war is welcome. Are you willing to help?<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>yes</b><br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Eroth\">Eroth</a>: Recently we found out that they are in the possession of a scrying crystal ball. They can hear all our discussions about tactics and upcoming attacks. ...<br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Eroth\">Eroth</a>: No wonder that they always have been so well prepared. Now you come into play, destroy the scrying crystal ball in Elvenbane. It should be on the top floor. ...<br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Eroth\">Eroth</a>: We don't really know how to destroy it but we suppose it may work if you reflect the invisible power of the ball. The beam should be adjusted to Ab'Dendriel. Take this mirror and give it a try. Good luck.<br/>\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">To Blind the Enemy Quest</strong></span>\n</p>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>hi</b><br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Eroth\">Eroth</a>: I greet thee, outsider.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>mission</b><br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Eroth\">Eroth</a>: I heard the blow! The reflection must have caused a overcharge of magical energy leading to the contraction and the implosion. Just like I hoped! Please take this as a reward. Thank you very much.\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">To Blind the Enemy Quest</strong></span>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<div class=\"messagebox\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Go Forward Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"25\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Go_Forward_Icon_f12cec.png\" width=\"25\"/></span><figcaption></figcaption></figure><p style=\"font-weight: bold;\">See also:</p><br/><p><a href=\"#/wiki/Tibia%20Tales\">Tibia Tales</a></p></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div></div></div>","quests":["elvenbane-quest"]}